{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cf604f4a2cba365a","name":"Sith Alchemical Weapon Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-cf604f4a2cba365a","title":"Sith Alchemical Weapon Template","revision":19323,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:44:22Z","sha256":"f1903c2ce161bb4edb5d145ce67d392670ce3819057c958ff626209d52e1811a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19323","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Alchemical%20Weapon%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cf604f4a2cba365a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 20% or 2,000 credits (whichever is higher) more than the base item\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sith Alchemical Weapons are items that have undergone an arcane enhancement process using ancient Sith techniques. Favored by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," in the days prior to the spread of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", Sith Alchemical Weapons are not only resistant to damage but also channel ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," through them. Ancient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"}," used Sith Alchemy to fundamentally alter the chemical makeup of their weapons, resulting in something far more dangerous than the typical sword or lanvarok. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," do not ignore a Sith Alchemical Weapon's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", and the characters who are proficient with the Sith Alchemical Weapon can treat it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," for the purpose of using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talents (as well as any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that have those Talents as a prerequisite).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, a Sith Alchemical Weapon becomes more powerful in the hands of a character who is steeped in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". A character proficient with a Sith Alchemical Weapon can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to gain a bonus to damage rolls with the Sith Alchemical Weapon equal to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". This bonus to damage applies to the next attack made with the Sith Alchemical Weapon before the end of the encounter, and activating this ability increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
